      "kind": "instruction",
      "path": "/home/jhx/combination_coverage/results/failure_analysis/deepswe_failed_trials_n211_20261006/trials/dynamodb-toolbox-conditional-att__dRJudvE/instruction.md",
      "sha256": "b3f779ea7ac151568f0dad3838f9bcdeabff7e4fca45677b26c406fa442a7fc6",
      "bytes": 1342,
      "line_count": 13,
      "anchors": [
        {
          "line": 1,
          "text": "Polymorphic single-table items need per-discriminator-value enforcement without losing schema safety, duplicating shared fields in `anyOf`, or splitting entities."
        },
        {
          "line": 3,
          "text": "A `requiredIf(attributeName, ...triggerValues)` builder method on all schema types within `map` or `item` declares an attribute required when a named sibling matches specified values, chainable with OR semantics."
        },
        {
          "line": 5,
          "text": "During put, a matching trigger with absent dependent throws `DynamoDBToolboxError`. Absent controlling attributes skip evaluation. Parsing-applied defaults satisfy requirements. Static `required` `always` takes unconditional precedence."
        },
        {
          "line": 7,
          "text": "During updates, setting a controlling attribute to a trigger value adds an `attribute_exists` condition for each missing dependent, so the database rejects the operation if the dependent is absent from the stored item. Update existence validation resolves full paths respecting `savedAs`."
        },
        {
          "line": 9,
          "text": "`check()` validates controlling attributes exist as siblings, rejects self-references, and rejects requirements on key attributes."
        },
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "DTO round-trips preserve behavior for all attribute types including `anyOf`. JSON Schema export enforces equivalent conditional presence. Formatter and parser Zod schemas enforce conditional requirements."
        },
        {
          "line": 13,
          "text": "IMPORTANT: Please work on this in a new branch from main and commit everything when you are done."
        }
      ]
    },
